WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:05.100
He's been going around the country,
he's been to over 10 cities so far,

00:05.100 --> 00:10.000
promoting Ghana to the diaspora, to business
communities and everyone else,

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
that Ghana is open for business,

00:13.000 --> 00:16.200
that people should come and invest in Ghana.

00:16.200 --> 00:20.000
But the one central message that he's maintained

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
is that he does not want Ghanaians
in the diaspora to be left behind,

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
that he wants Ghanaians in the diaspora
to partner with investors,

00:28.000 --> 00:31.900
come home, set up businesses
that will employ the youth,

00:31.900 --> 00:35.300
and curb the youth migration, curb the brain drain.

00:35.300 --> 00:37.800
So that's what he's been doing.

00:37.800 --> 00:43.000
The name Region 17 stems out of,
because this is a Ghanaian community town hall,

00:43.000 --> 00:48.000
I'm sure everybody knows that Ghana
has 16 regions within our borders.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.400
The president last year
at the diaspora summit in Accra

00:52.400 --> 00:56.500
declared the African diaspora
as the 17th region.

00:56.500 --> 00:58.700
He did that because

00:58.700 --> 01:03.400
last year, 2021, remittances
from the diaspora alone

01:03.400 --> 01:07.100
was 7.8 billion US dollars.
